Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 17:58:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] arm64: dts: exynos2200: add b0s (S22 Ultra) and its
 kexec-payload variant

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/Makefile           |   4 +-
 .../boot/dts/exynos/exynos2200-b0s-kx.dts     | 166 +++++++++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos2200-b0s.dts | 225 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 394 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100755 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos2200-b0s-kx.dts
